Z||000000||fyerstarter||05-05-2001||10:46 PM||||I was wondering how the heck you get the gas pedal off? I found the spring on the back that makes it spring back in place but I can't quite see how to detach the whole pedal. Anyone done this?||||reg||1
Z||000001||fiero56||05-05-2001||10:52 PM||||There are one or two bolts right on front facing your foot(10mm???). You just remove them and the pedal assembly comes right off.||||reg||1
